# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Real Deal — Environment Variables
#
# Copy this file's structure into Vercel project Settings → Environment
# Variables (Production scope). Values below show the format / where to get
# them; never commit real values. Each var is grouped by feature, with the
# minimum set required for the platform to function at top.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


# ── REQUIRED · Core AI features (chat, deal memo, comps, triggers, document parsing)
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com → API Keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-...


# ── REQUIRED · Auth + saved deals + saved searches + market subscriptions
# Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API
SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
# anon key is exposed to the client (used by Supabase JS in the browser);
# safe to commit, kept here only for documentation.
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...
#
# service_role is SERVER-ONLY — bypasses RLS so the cron handler can read
# every user's saved searches + market subscriptions. NEVER expose to client.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...


# ── REQUIRED for paid plans · Stripe checkout
# Stripe Dashboard → Developers → API keys (Live mode)
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_...
# Stripe → Products → create $99/mo + $299/mo recurring prices, paste their IDs:
STRIPE_PRO_PRICE_ID=price_...
STRIPE_SCALE_PRICE_ID=price_...
# Webhook signing secret — Stripe → Developers → Webhooks → endpoint
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...


# ── REQUIRED for email digests · Resend
# Resend Dashboard → API Keys
RESEND_API_KEY=re_...
# Sender email — must use a domain you've verified in Resend (Domains tab),
# OR start with onboarding@resend.dev to send today without DNS setup.
RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=Real Deal <brief@realdealestate.app>


# ── REQUIRED for Vercel cron · weekly trigger digest + daily market brief
# Vercel auto-fills this when you enable Cron Jobs in the project dashboard
# (Settings → Cron Jobs). The cron-* endpoints validate it as Bearer token.
CRON_SECRET=auto-generated-by-vercel


# ── OPTIONAL · US property data via RentCast
# Sign up at https://app.rentcast.io. Without this, US addresses on
# /property degrade gracefully (Canadian addresses use free open-data).
RENTCAST_API_KEY=...


# ── OPTIONAL · Calgary open-data higher quota
# Default quota is fine for most use; only set if rate-limited.
# Apply at https://data.calgary.ca → Developer Settings → App Token
CALGARY_APP_TOKEN=...


# ── FUTURE · CREA DDF (official Canadian MLS data)
# Requires CREA membership or partner-brokerage agreement.
# Apply at https://www.crea.ca/dataandstats/data-distribution-facility/
# When set, the MLS provider factory auto-picks DDF over Repliers / Realtor.ca.
# DDF_USERNAME=...
# DDF_PASSWORD=...


# ── FUTURE · Repliers.io (paid MLS aggregator)
# Easier signup than DDF, paid ($500+/mo). https://repliers.io
# When set (and DDF not), MLS provider factory picks this over Realtor.ca.
# REPLIERS_API_KEY=...
